    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fintan Cahill Auctioneers are delighted to present this charming four-bedroom bungalow to the market. Ideally located in a mature and highly sought-after residential area of Navan, this attractive home sits on a generous site of just under half an acre, offering both privacy and superb outdoor space. \r\nThe accommodation is well laid out and comprises four spacious bedrooms, a family bathroom, and a large kitchen/dining area perfect for everyday family living and entertaining alike. \r\nThe real highlight of this wonderful property is the beautifully maintained rear garden. The mature grounds are meticulously manicured and provide a peaceful, private setting. A stone-built covered barbecue area with seating creates the perfect space for outdoor dining and entertaining during the warmer months. There is also a greenhouse for the gardening enthusiast. \r\nAdding to the appeal is a superb sauna complete with ante room and covered patio area, providing an ideal retreat to relax and unwind in the evenings. This is a rare opportunity to acquire a well-maintained home with exceptional outdoor amenities in an established and convenient location close to all the amenities Navan has to offer."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Great location in Navan\r\nFantastic mature back garden with greenhouse, barbecue area and sauna\r\nMaintenance free front garden with plenty of off street parking\r\nGarage\r\nGas fired central heating\r\nMains water & waste"
      },
      {
